      {
        "type": "heading",
        "defaultValue": "Sound"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "defaultValue": "The Pebble Time 2 and Pebble 2 Duo have a speaker. Several time systems separate their fields by strength, and a Pebble motor has no strength control at all, so that dimension is lost when you feel it. On the speaker it returns as pitch — stronger means higher. Off by default, and the watch's mute setting is always obeyed."
      },
